{"id":"vod_sn_36423","vodId":"36423","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"间谍过家家第二季","name_cn":"间谍过家家第二季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231008-1/68ce0b5a76ad9c04a96397be4d9bdfba.jpg"},"summary":"每个人都有不可告人的一面——\r\n　　这是一个世界各国均暗地里进行激烈情报战的时代。东国（Ostania）与西国（Westalis）的冷战状态已经持续数十年。“黄昏”是西国情报局东国对策科“WISE”的一名优秀间谍。为调查威胁东西两国和平的人物——东国国家统一党总裁多诺万·德斯蒙，上级给予了他一个绝密任务。\r\n　　任务名为：“枭”（Strix）行动。内容是“一周之内组建家庭，潜入德斯蒙儿子就读的名门学校的联谊会”。于是“黄昏”扮演成精神科医生劳埃德·福杰，开始组建家庭。然而，他找来的女儿阿尼亚是个能读心的超能力者，妻子约尔是个杀手。三人利害关系一致，便互相隐瞒身份，开始了共同生活。\r\n　　世界的和平，就掌握在这意外不断的临时一家人手中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-23 23:57:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/08/b2wQtZEv192/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/15/f1EHRBqNKv2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/22/ydAGGFyJV52/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202310/29/h7JvzxRBMp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/05/7JVf77k4ib2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/12/LKiYx9wKNr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/19/pAAV4J0qGX2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/25/90eTJjVPjy2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202312/02/wx578giR4B2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202312/09/Cd7nrxjT4e2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202312/16/fiAFKsFCaX2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202312/23/56b3iLrsPA2/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:46.432Z"}